  "description": "The maximum independent set track of FrontierCO (Feng et al., 2025), 73 undirected graphs in the DIMACS graph format (`p edge`, then `e` lines): 37 easy test instances that are the complements of graphs of the Second DIMACS Implementation Challenge's clique benchmark (brock, C, DSJC, gen, hamming, keller, MANN and p_hat), so that an independent set here is a clique there, 16 hard test instances from BHOSLIB (the frb graphs of Xu et al.'s model RB, with hidden optimum) and 20 validation instances generated from the same RB model. Each instance is a graph whose nodes are 1 to n, isolated ones included, with one edge per line; FrontierCO's reference value for each instance is in the track's config.py.",
  "domain": "Maximum independent set",
  "expectedCounts": {
    "instances": 73
  },
